{"id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-prefix.md","title":"有限与无限序列的前缀","display":"df-prefix — 有限与无限序列的前缀","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-prefix","aliases":["43-df-prefix"],"display":"df-prefix — 有限与无限序列的前缀","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§4.1–4.2, print pp.2–3 / PDF pp.22–23","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-prefix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-prefix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prefix — 有限与无限序列的前缀"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§4.1–4.2, print pp.2–3 / PDF pp.22–23"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a> 的函数图表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\iff\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau,\\qquad\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\iff\\sigma\\subseteq X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\iff\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau,\\qquad\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\iff\\sigma\\subseteq X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\sqsubset\\tau\\iff\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\land\\sigma\\ne\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\sqsubset\\tau\\iff\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\land\\sigma\\ne\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\iff\\neg(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\land\\neg(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\iff\\neg(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\land\\neg(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限二进串的定义域是自然数初始段，因而函数图包含恰好等价于通常前缀关系。新公式适用于任意长度比较，不需对过短串调用截断。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§4.1–4.2, print pp.2–3 / PDF pp.22–23。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，采用 [[43-df-string]] 与 [[43-df-infseq]] 的函数图表示。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，采用 [[43-df-string]] 与 [[43-df-infseq]] 的函数图表示。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\iff\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau,\\qquad\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\iff\\sigma\\subseteq X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\sqsubset\\tau\\iff\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\land\\sigma\\ne\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\iff\\neg(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\land\\neg(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma).","display":true}],"bytes":1249,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$；前缀关系见 [[43-df-prefix]]。$\\operatorname{OpenHull}(S)$ 是下式定义的柱集并；本页不将它记为 $[S]$，树的 $[T]$ 专用于路径集。$\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 为下式生成的Borel σ代数。$\\mu$ 是满足下式的概率测度；其存在唯一性采用标准可数乘积测度定理。"},{"id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\sqsubseteq$、$\\Sigma^0_n$、$\\#_2$ 分别采用 [[43-df-prefix]]、[[43-df-sigman]]、[[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\mathcal S_n$ 为下式定义的有限串集族。"},{"id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；有限串集合采用 [[43-df-string]]，前缀关系 $\\sqsubseteq$ 采用 [[43-df-prefix]]。以下定义谓词 $\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$。"},{"id":"a89886ac0073ec91","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$D\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\sqsubseteq$、$\\operatorname{ComputableReal}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefix]]、[[43-df-computable-real]]；$w_s$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]。"},{"id":"64d83554d467a24a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]] — 有限与无限序列的前缀"},{"id":"f2cc5f0641c3417d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)$（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$\\nu\\in2^{<\\omega}$。设 $F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(F)$（see [[43-df-prefixfree]]）；$\\sqsubseteq$ 采用 [[43-df-prefix]] 的非严格前缀关系，允许F无限。"},{"id":"cf25a3052897e372","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$A\\in2^\\omega$。$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)$ 见 [[43-df-genericity]]；$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。域为 Cantor 乘积拓扑，值域为实数通常拓扑。"},{"id":"ac689c2d93db0966","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{OraclePF}(M)$；$\\Omega_M^A$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。$2^\\omega$ 带柱集生成的乘积拓扑。"},{"id":"99a0eabcf30b9356","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]，$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}